  "translation": "Yawe na Israel fo, i n'a fɔ burukurun min bɛ ji kɔnɔ nin ka ɲagami cogo min na; a na Israel bɔ dugukolo ɲuman nin na, minnu o ma u baaww ye; a na u wasa ji kan kɔfɛ, sabu u ye ⟨את⟩ Asheraw (Asera tɔgɔbɔnw) dilan, u ka Yawe kɛ dusujuguya kɛ.",
